sequenceDiagram
  participant C as Client
  participant API as Payments API
  participant DB as Database
  C->>API: POST /payments (Idempotency-Key: k1)
  API->>DB: INSERT key k1 (IN_PROGRESS)
  API->>DB: debit + ledger (same transaction)
  API->>DB: key k1 = DONE, response 201 {...}
  API--xC: 201 response lost (timeout)
  C->>API: retry POST /payments (Idempotency-Key: k1)
  API->>DB: INSERT key k1 → already exists
  DB-->>API: DONE, stored response
  API-->>C: same 201 {...} — no second charge
